  "license": "MIT (repository LICENSE, Copyright (c) 2019 xiangyuecn); ok_geo.csv is marked free/open for use in the bundled data doc. Upstream administrative data compiled from 国家地名信息库 2025-12-31, 腾讯地图行政区划 2025-11-19 and 高德地图行政区划.",
  "native_coord_system": "gcj02",
  "levels": "prefecture-level cities/prefectures/leagues/autonomous prefectures nationwide, plus district-level rows for the 4 direct-administered municipalities (北京/上海/天津/重庆); Hong Kong and Macau included as single points. No province-level rows. Taiwan omitted (source has no coordinates for it).",
  "keys": "Each place is keyed by its full name (石家庄市) and by its suffix-stripped short name (石家庄); autonomous prefectures also carry the ethnonym-free forms (大理白族自治州 -> 大理, 大理州, 大理自治州). Aliases that would collide with another place or with a province short name are omitted (朝阳, 河北, 海南).",
  "caveat": "Municipality district names such as 和平区 / 朝阳区 / 东城区 and short keys like 中山 / 东城 / 东方 / 北屯 also occur as street or district names elsewhere (沈阳, 长春, 聊城, and throughout Taiwan). A bare longest-substring match over the whole country puts about 0.4% of rows in the wrong city (measured: 22 of 5748 resolved on this repo China set); treat a hit on such a short key as low confidence and prefer a candidate consistent with the row province when one is known. Taiwan is not in this file, so Taiwanese addresses must be skipped rather than matched - 中山路 / 北屯路 otherwise resolve to mainland 中山市 / 北屯市. Centroids are current government-seat points, so a few sit away from the conventional city centre (昆明 is at 呈贡, ~0.15 deg south-east of the old centre)."
 },
